{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { Date.now })","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"